<!-- LAMP — apertura isotérmica, primer bucle y cascada de amplificación -->
<div class="wrapper">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Animación LAMP">

    <!-- Temperature badge -->
    <rect x="8" y="4" width="52" height="16" rx="5" fill="rgba(255,179,0,0.12)" stroke="rgba(255,179,0,0.5)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="34" y="15" fill="#ffb300" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">65°C cte.</text>

    <!-- Technique badge -->
    <rect x="218" y="4" width="54" height="16" rx="5" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.1)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="245" y="15" fill="#00e5ff" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">LAMP</text>

    <!-- dsDNA — draws in phase 1 -->
    <line x1="40" y1="68" x2="240" y2="68" stroke="#00e5ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" class="dna-top" />
    <line x1="40" y1="78" x2="240" y2="78" stroke="#b388ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" class="dna-bot" />

    <!-- Strand separation dots — visible in phase 1 -->
    {[80, 110, 140, 170, 200].map((x) => (
      <circle cx={x} cy={73} r="2" fill="#64748b" class="sep-dot" />
    ))}

    <!-- Loop 1 (left) — draws in phase 2 -->
    <path
      d="M 80,68 Q 60,40 80,25 Q 100,10 120,25 Q 140,40 120,68"
      stroke="#39ff14" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"
      class="loop-1"
    />

    <!-- Loop 2 (right) — draws in phase 3 -->
    <path
      d="M 160,68 Q 150,42 165,28 Q 180,14 195,28 Q 210,42 200,68"
      stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"
      class="loop-2"
    />

    <!-- Loop 3 (nested, lower) — draws in phase 3 -->
    <path
      d="M 110,78 Q 100,95 115,108 Q 130,118 145,108 Q 160,96 150,78"
      stroke="#b388ff" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"
      class="loop-3"
    />

    <!-- Cascade label — phase 3 -->
    <text x="140" y="148" fill="#39ff14" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="cascade-label">→ amplificación exponencial isotérmica</text>
  </svg>

  <!-- Leyenda estática -->
  <div class="legend">
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#00e5ff"></span>cadena superior (ADN template)</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#b388ff"></span>cadena complementaria</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#39ff14"></span>bucle = estructura stem-loop autorreplicante</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:#64748b"></span>puntos = separación de cadenas a 65°C</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Pasos sincronizados (loop 9s) -->
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step s1">
      <span class="snum">1/3</span>
      <p>A <strong>65°C constante</strong> el ADN se desnaturaliza sin termociclador. Un baño de agua o resistencia eléctrica es suficiente.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s2">
      <span class="snum">2/3</span>
      <p>Un primer especial (FIP/BIP) invade la cadena abierta y sintetiza el primer <strong>bucle stem-loop</strong>. La estructura es autorreplicante.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s3">
      <span class="snum">3/3</span>
      <p>Los bucles se auto-primerían en cascada generando amplificación exponencial. Resultado visible (turbidez o color) en <strong>15–30 min</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  svg { width: 100%; }

  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .lbar { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 2px; border-radius: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldot { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .steps { position: relative; height: 5rem; }
  .step {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    background: rgba(0,229,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.12);
    border-radius: 5px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .snum {
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan); flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: bold; padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .step p { font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0; }
  .step strong { color: var(--accent-amber); font-weight: 600; }

  /* SVG — 9s loop */
  .dna-top {
    stroke-dasharray: 200; stroke-dashoffset: 200;
    animation: lamp-dna 9s ease infinite;
  }
  .dna-bot {
    stroke-dasharray: 200; stroke-dashoffset: 200;
    animation: lamp-dna 9s ease infinite;
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .sep-dot { animation: lamp-sep 9s ease infinite; }
  .loop-1 {
    stroke-dasharray: 180; stroke-dashoffset: 180;
    animation: lamp-loop1 9s ease infinite;
  }
  .loop-2 {
    stroke-dasharray: 160; stroke-dashoffset: 160;
    animation: lamp-loop23 9s ease infinite;
  }
  .loop-3 {
    stroke-dasharray: 160; stroke-dashoffset: 160;
    animation: lamp-loop23 9s ease infinite;
    animation-delay: 0.4s;
  }
  .cascade-label { animation: lamp-cascade 9s ease infinite; }

  @keyframes lamp-dna {
    0%      { stroke-dashoffset: 200; opacity: 0; }
    3%      { opacity: 1; }
    10%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 1; }
    100%    { stroke-dashoffset: 200; opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes lamp-sep {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    15%     { opacity: 0; }
    20%     { opacity: 0.6; }
    96%     { opacity: 0.6; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes lamp-loop1 {
    0%      { stroke-dashoffset: 180; }
    33.33%  { stroke-dashoffset: 180; }
    55%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100%    { stroke-dashoffset: 180; }
  }
  @keyframes lamp-loop23 {
    0%      { stroke-dashoffset: 160; }
    66.66%  { stroke-dashoffset: 160; }
    84%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100%    { stroke-dashoffset: 160; }
  }
  @keyframes lamp-cascade {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; }
    72%     { opacity: 1; }
    96%     { opacity: 1; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Pasos de texto — 9s loop */
  @keyframes s1 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    3%      { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    29%     { opacity: 1; }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s2 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    37%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    62%     { opacity: 1; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s3 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    70%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    96%     { opacity: 1; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  }
  .s1 { animation: s1 9s ease infinite; }
  .s2 { animation: s2 9s ease infinite; }
  .s3 { animation: s3 9s ease infinite; }
</style>
